# The Android project is generated by `cargo tauri android init` and patched by
# scripts/patch-android-project.sh, both of which CI runs on every build — so
# there is nothing here worth committing. That includes the bundled cloudflared
# (~28 MB per ABI), which gets the same treatment as the desktop sidecar in
# /binaries/: built at build time, never committed.
/gen/android/
